# Claude Code MCP servers overlay for the `server-headless` profile.
# Active on hosts where profile_tag == server-headless (e.g. linuxbro, superbro).
#
# Format (same as mcp-servers.list):
#   name | command | arg1 | arg2 | ...
#   name | http    | https://host/mcp
#
# Disable an MCP enabled by the base list:
#   !name
#
# Lines starting with '#' are comments. Blank lines ignored.

# Disable desktop/dev-only MCPs
!google-calendar
!atlassian-fiskars
!atlassian-akqa
